"Live from IRSA's all-sky maps (HiPS) via Aladin Lite. Drag to pan, scroll to zoom. Slide the wavelength: cold brown dwarfs appear only at the long end, normal stars fade there. The orange marker is the target; the dashed line is its measured path. This map works for any coordinates you type.": "即時來自 IRSA 的全天圖（HiPS），由 Aladin Lite 顯示。拖動平移，滾動縮放。滑動波長：冷的褐矮星只在長波端出現，普通恆星在那裏會變暗。橙色標記是目標；虛線是它的實測路徑。這張圖適用於你輸入的任何座標。",
"Matches these coordinates against the outlines of every public JWST imaging frame in NASA’s MAST archive and shows the real pixels.": "將這些座標與 NASA MAST 檔案中每一幅公開 JWST 成像畫面的輪廓進行匹配，並顯示真實像素。",
