"Dots seen only in WISE 2010 are paired with dots seen only in SPHEREx at 4.6 µm, 8″ to 190″ apart and of similar brightness. Each pair is then checked against the target's path, Gaia DR3 and SIMBAD. Asteroids and comets are not checked. An unconfirmed pair is not a discovery.": "只在 WISE 2010 中出現的亮點，會與只在 4.6 µm 的 SPHEREx 中出現的亮點配對，兩者相距 8″ 到 190″，亮度相近。然後每一對都會與目標路徑、Gaia DR3 和 SIMBAD 核對。小行星和彗星不在檢查範圍內。未經確認的配對不算發現。",
