"How: the learnt present-day state is carried through 3D space at constant velocity (the model behind astropy's": "方法：把學到的當前狀態以恆定速度帶過三維空間（這是 astropy 的",
"). The pink cloud is 300 runs with the starting values varied by their uncertainties. The Galaxy's gravity, which bends real paths over millions of years, and orbits around companions are not included.": "背後的模型）。粉色雲團是 300 次運行，起始值按各自的不確定度變化。銀河系的引力會在數百萬年裏彎曲真實路徑，伴星的軌道運動也未包括在內。",
