"242 of 242 SPHEREx measurements (100%) were left out because of flagged pixels near the target. None were usable, so there is no spectrum. This object is bright enough to saturate SPHEREx at many wavelengths.": "242 個 SPHEREx 測量值中有 242 個（100%）因目標附近有被標記的像素而被剔除。沒有可用的測量值，所以沒有光譜。這個天體很亮，會讓 SPHEREx 在許多波長上飽和。",
"A measurement is left out if pixels near the target are flagged for: saturation (overflow), bloom, ghosts, streaks, persistence, cross-talk, non-linear pixels, hot, cold or non-functional pixels, missing data, transients, snowballs, halos. This is the conservative set from the SPHEREx Explanatory Supplement. The flipbook pictures hide only broken detector pixels, so bright stars stay visible.": "如果目標附近的像素被標記為以下任一情況，該測量值就會被剔除：飽和（溢出）、光暈擴散（bloom）、鬼影、條紋、殘留、串擾、非線性像素、熱像素、冷像素或失效像素、數據缺失、瞬變、雪球、暈。這是 SPHEREx 解釋性補充文件中的保守設置。翻頁圖只隱藏損壞的探測器像素，所以亮星仍然可見。",
