". 228 saturated at the target pixel. 242 have flags within 3 pixels of the target: OVERFLOW ×241, TRANSIENT ×239, BLOOM ×239, SUR_ERROR ×238, NONFUNC ×27, PERSIST ×10, HALO ×5, HOT ×4, DICHROIC ×3, COLD ×3. 0 are used in the spectrum. Flag names are the SPHEREx pipeline's (Explanatory Supplement); hover a flag for its meaning.": "。228 張在目標像素處飽和。242 張在目標 3 像素內有標記：OVERFLOW ×241、TRANSIENT ×239、BLOOM ×239、SUR_ERROR ×238、NONFUNC ×27、PERSIST ×10、HALO ×5、HOT ×4、DICHROIC ×3、COLD ×3。0 張用於光譜。標記名稱來自 SPHEREx 處理流程（解釋性補充文件）；把滑鼠懸停在標記上可看含義。",
