"Affected by a bright source on another detector": "受另一個探測器上明亮源影響",
"Pixel affected by a bright source outside FOV": "像素受視場外明亮源影響",
"Pixel affected by a streak": "像素受條紋影響",
"Pixel part of a snowball artifact": "像素屬於雪球偽影",
"How the verdict is decided": "判定是怎麼得出的",
"One SPHEREx image is poor when the pixel at the target is saturated (OVERFLOW), blank, outside the image or carries a flag that makes a pixel unusable; caution when the target pixel is fine but another pixel within 3 pixels of the target is flagged or blank (that image is then left out of the spectrum); otherwise good.": "一張 SPHEREx 圖像在以下情況判為“較差”：目標處的像素飽和（OVERFLOW）、為空白、在圖像之外，或帶有使像素不可用的標記；當目標像素沒問題，但目標 3 像素內的其他像素被標記或空白時，判為“需注意”（這張圖像隨後會被排除在光譜之外）；其餘判為“良好”。",
"A stacked frame is poor when at least half of its images are poor, or the stacked picture is blank at the target; caution when any image is saturated at the target, at least a quarter are poor, at least half have flagged or blank pixels within 3 pixels of the target, or an image did not pass the SPHEREx pipeline's own quality check (L2DQAFLG); otherwise good. A frame of one image takes that image's verdict.": "疊加畫面在至少一半圖像較差，或疊加圖在目標處為空白時判為“較差”；當任一圖像在目標處飽和、至少四分之一較差、至少一半在目標 3 像素內有標記或空白像素，或有圖像未通過 SPHEREx 處理流程自身的質素檢查（L2DQAFLG）時，判為“需注意”；其餘判為“良好”。只有一張圖像的畫面沿用該圖像的判定。",
"The combined frame is poor when at least half of its detector co-adds are poor; caution when any co-add is poor, any image is saturated at the target, or at least half of the co-adds need caution; otherwise good.": "合併畫面在其探測器疊加圖至少一半較差時判為“較差”；當任一疊加圖較差、任一圖像在目標處飽和，或至少一半疊加圖需注意時，判為“需注意”；其餘判為“良好”。",
"WISE and NEOWISE frames come without flag planes here, so only blank pixels and a saturated (blanked) core are checked: poor when the core is saturated or the target pixel is blank, caution when a pixel within 3 pixels of the target is blank.": "這裏的 WISE 和 NEOWISE 畫面沒有標記層，所以只檢查空白像素和飽和（被置空）的核心：核心飽和或目標像素空白時判為“較差”，目標 3 像素內有像素空白時判為“需注意”。",
"Open this field in Aladin Lite ↗": "在 Aladin Lite 中打開這片天區 ↗",
"CDS sky viewer, showing the WISE infrared survey. Opens a new tab and sends it only this patch's coordinates.": "CDS 星空查看器，顯示 WISE 紅外巡天。會打開新分頁，只發送這個天區的座標。",
