"KNOWN OBJECT": "已知天體",
"Confidence:": "可信度：",
"high": "高",
"· 3 of 3 key checks support it": "· 3 項關鍵檢查中有 3 項支持",
"242 of 242 SPHEREx measurements flagged (overflow or bloom: the object is too bright for SPHEREx). No reliable SPHEREx spectrum, so we do not show one.": "242 個 SPHEREx 測量值中有 242 個被標記（溢出或光暈擴散：天體對 SPHEREx 來説太亮）。沒有可靠的 SPHEREx 光譜，所以我們不顯示。",
"measured motion": "實測運動",
"catalogue motion (Gaia DR3)": "星表運動（Gaia DR3）",
"brightness change Aug 2025→Aug 2026": "亮度變化 2025年8月→2026年8月",
"distance (Gaia parallax)": "距離（Gaia 視差）",
"temperature (Gaia estimate)": "温度（Gaia 估計）",
"What this tells us": "這告訴我們什麼",
"(worked out from the numbers above)": "（由上面的數字算出）",
"About 91 km/s across the sky": "橫越天空的速度約 91 km/s",
"That is 3.1 times the speed of Earth around the Sun. It is sideways speed only: motion toward or away from us does not show in images.": "這是地球繞太陽速度的 3.1 倍。這只是橫向速度：朝向或遠離我們的運動在圖像中看不出來。",
"How: 4.74 × 10.55″/yr ÷ parallax 0.547″": "算法：4.74 × 10.55″/yr ÷ 視差 0.547″",
"Crosses the width of the full Moon in about 170 years": "約 170 年走過滿月的寬度",
"A typical star in these images needs more than 100,000 years, which is why this one stands out in a flipbook.": "圖像中一顆普通恆星需要 10 萬年以上，所以這顆星在翻頁圖裏很顯眼。",
"How: 1,800″ ÷ 10.55″/yr": "算法：1,800″ ÷ 10.55″/yr",
"6.0 light-years away: one of the Sun's nearest neighbours": "距離 6.0 光年：太陽最近的鄰居之一",
"The light in these images left it about 6.0 years ago.": "這些圖像中的光大約在 6.0 年前離開它。",
"How: 3.26 ÷ parallax (″), Gaia DR3": "算法：3.26 ÷ 視差（″），Gaia DR3",
"About 3,100 K at its surface": "表面温度約 3,100 K",
"That is 54% of the Sun's surface temperature (5,772 K), so it glows mostly in infrared light.": "這是太陽表面温度（5,772 K）的 54%，所以它主要發出紅外光。",
"How: Gaia DR3 estimate from its colours": "算法：Gaia DR3 根據顏色估計",
"What this view cannot show": "這個視圖看不到什麼",
"Motion: an object must shift 2 SPHEREx pixels (12″) to count as moving. Over these 16.1 years that means faster than 0.76″ per year. Slower objects read as “no measurable motion”.": "運動：天體必須移動 2 個 SPHEREx 像素（12″）才算在運動。在這 16.1 年裏，這意味着速度要大於每年 0.76″。更慢的天體會顯示為“無可測運動”。",
"SPHEREx alone covers only 12 months here: by the same 2-pixel rule, enough only for motion faster than 13″ per year. The 2010 WISE image is what makes slower motion visible.": "單靠 SPHEREx 這裏只覆蓋 12 個月：按同樣的 2 像素規則，只夠看出每年快於 13″ 的運動。2010 年的 WISE 圖像才讓更慢的運動變得可見。",
"Brightness: compared at 3 SPHEREx visits only. A change between or outside those dates is not seen.": "亮度：只比較了 3 次 SPHEREx 訪問。這些日期之間或之外的變化看不到。",
"Bright stars: this one overflows SPHEREx pixels, so its spectrum and exact brightness are not reliable here.": "亮星：這顆星會使 SPHEREx 像素溢出，所以這裏它的光譜和確切亮度不可靠。",
"Solar System: the page checks against Gaia stars only. It does not check asteroids or comets, so a moving dot without a Gaia circle may be a known asteroid.": "太陽系：本頁只與 Gaia 恆星比對。不檢查小行星或彗星，所以沒有 Gaia 圓圈的移動亮點可能是已知小行星。",
"Crowding: one SPHEREx pixel is 6.15″ wide, so two close objects can blend into one dot and one spectrum.": "擁擠：一個 SPHEREx 像素寬 6.15″，所以兩個靠得很近的天體可能混成一個點，只得到一條光譜。",
