"Sending a vote needs a free GitHub account and creates a public issue in the team's repository (kneha07/WANDERERS), showing your vote and your GitHub name.": "提交投票需要一個免費的 GitHub 賬號，並會在團隊倉庫（kneha07/WANDERERS）建立一個公開 issue，顯示你的投票和你的 GitHub 名字。",
