"WANDERERS points people at interesting objects and shows the evidence. Confirming a new object needs follow-up by astronomers.": "WANDERERS 帶你找到有趣的天體並展示證據。要確認新天體，還需要天文學家的後續觀測。",
"Data: SPHEREx DR1 and QR3 (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · AllWISE and NEOWISE (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · Gaia DR3 (ESA) · Webb frames: MAST (STScI) and ESA ESASky · star names: HYG (CC BY-SA 4.0). NASA Space Apps 2026 · Planet X and SPHEREx. WANDERERS is an independent student project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by NASA or ESA.": "數據：SPHEREx DR1 和 QR3 (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · AllWISE 和 NEOWISE (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · Gaia DR3 (ESA) · Webb 圖像：MAST (STScI) 和 ESA ESASky · 恆星名稱：HYG (CC BY-SA 4.0)。NASA Space Apps 2026 · Planet X and SPHEREx。WANDERERS 是一個獨立的學生項目，與 NASA 或 ESA 無關聯，也未獲其認可。",
