"No mover reported within 10″ of the star's predicted position (survey tile 3325). At W1 ≈ 2 it is far brighter than NEOWISE can measure: the single-exposure table holds only scattered-light halo detections around it (cc_flags 'H', W1 11-14), never the star itself, so no search of that table can find it.": "在這顆星預測位置 10″ 以內沒有報告移動天體（巡天圖塊 3325）。它的 W1 ≈ 2，比 NEOWISE 能測量的亮得多：單次曝光表裏只有它周圍的散射光暈探測（cc_flags 'H'，W1 11-14），從來沒有這顆星本身，所以在那張表裏怎麼搜都找不到它。",
