"Red": "紅色",
"is a hint, not proof: cold brown dwarfs are red in W1−W2 because methane absorbs their light in W1 (3.4 µm). Filters and sort are kept in the address, so a shared link shows the same list.": "只是提示，不是證據：冷褐矮星在 W1−W2 中是紅色的，因為甲烷吸收了它們在 W1 (3.4 µm) 的光。篩選和排序會儲存在網址中，所以分享連結會顯示同樣的列表。",
