"Download this list (every page, as filtered and sorted):": "下載這份列表（所有頁面，按當前篩選和排序）：",
"Ranked moving-object candidates from the WANDERERS Sky Survey. Sort with the column buttons; open a candidate with its ID button.": "來自 WANDERERS 巡天的已排名移動天體候選體。用列按鈕排序；用 ID 按鈕打開候選體。",
