"What this search cannot tell you": "這次搜尋不能告訴你什麼",
"Only the tiles listed here have been searched; the rest of the sky has not been processed yet.": "這裏只列出已搜尋的圖塊；天空的其餘部分還沒有處理。",
"Motions slower than 150 mas per year or faster than 12 arcseconds per year are not searched.": "每年慢於 150 mas 或快於 12 角秒的運動不在搜尋範圍內。",
"A source must be detected in at least 6 of the roughly 20 WISE visits, so very faint or very red objects near the detection limit can be missed.": "一個源必須在大約 20 次 WISE 巡天中至少 6 次被探測到，所以接近探測極限的很暗或很紅的天體可能被漏掉。",
"'Unexplained' means no Gaia DR3 star with a matching motion lies within 3 arcseconds. That is expected for cold brown dwarfs too faint for Gaia, but blends, artefacts next to bright stars and tracks cut at tile edges can look the same.": "“未解釋”是指 3 角秒內沒有運動匹配的 Gaia DR3 恆星。對於暗到 Gaia 看不到的冷褐矮星，這是正常的，但混合源、亮星旁邊的偽影和在圖塊邊緣被截斷的軌跡看起來也可能一樣。",
"A track that crosses a tile edge is split between the two tiles. When both parts are found and agree in position and motion they are counted once (the longer track is kept); a part too short to be found on its own is lost.": "跨過圖塊邊緣的軌跡會被分到兩個圖塊。如果兩部分都被找到，並且位置和運動一致，就只算一次（保留較長的軌跡）；太短而無法單獨找到的那一部分會丟失。",
"Motions come from a straight-line fit; parallax is fitted only where a value is given, so very nearby objects can have slightly biased motions.": "運動來自直線擬合；只有給出了數值的地方才會擬合視差，所以非常近的天體，其運動可能有輕微偏差。",
"SPHEREx has no public source catalogue yet; its check measures the all-sky DR1 spectral cube directly at each predicted position. Its pixels are about 13 arcseconds across, so it can only see motions of more than a few pixels over 2014-2026 (roughly 1 arcsecond per year and faster); slower movers can only be shown to be there. Two sources less than a pixel apart are blended, so a spectrum can include a neighbour's light.": "SPHEREx 還沒有公開的源星表；它的檢查是在每個預測位置直接測量全天 DR1 光譜立方體。它的像素約 13 角秒寬，所以只能看到 2014-2026 年間移動超過幾個像素的運動（大約每年 1 角秒及更快）；更慢的移動天體只能證明它在那裏。相距不到一個像素的兩個源會混在一起，所以光譜可能包含鄰居的光。",
"A candidate is not a discovery: each one needs a human check of the images and other catalogues first.": "候選體不是發現：每一個都要先由人檢查圖像和其他星表。",
"\"Unexplained\" means only that Gaia DR3 has no matching moving star. Many such objects are already known from other surveys (brown dwarfs are too faint and cold for Gaia), and some are artefacts the cuts missed.": "“未解釋”只表示 Gaia DR3 沒有匹配的移動恆星。許多這樣的天體已被其他巡天發現（褐矮星對 Gaia 來説太暗太冷），還有一些是篩選沒剔除的偽影。",
"Only people looking at the images, then follow-up observations, can confirm anything new.": "只有人來查看圖像，再加上後續觀測，才能確認任何新發現。",
"The run's own description of its method": "這次運行對自身方法的説明",
"Each processed tile holds every NEOWISE single-exposure detection from 2014 to 2024 (about 20 million per tile). Detections that fail basic quality cuts (artefact flags, bad frames, moonlight, weak signal) are dropped. WISE scanned each part of the sky about every six months, so the detections of one source in one scan are averaged into a single position per visit. Those positions are linked across the ten years into tracks, including fast movers of up to 12 arcseconds per year, and a straight-line fit gives each track's proper motion and its uncertainty. Tracks seen in at least 6 visits that move at least 150 mas per year with at least 5 sigma are kept as movers. Each mover is compared with Gaia DR3 stars moved to the same date with their own motion. Every mover Gaia does not explain is then looked up in SPHEREx's all-sky spectral cube (data release 1, observed 2025-26): is a source there, where its NEOWISE motion says it should be by then, and gone from where it was in 2014? SPHEREx also gives its 0.75-5 micron spectrum, from which a methane dip at 3.3 microns and a red 3-5 micron colour (signs of a cold brown dwarf) are read as hints. Movers are then ranked: those Gaia does not explain, that are red, that SPHEREx sees where predicted and that have long, clean tracks come first. The top of the list is for people to investigate.": "每個已處理的圖塊包含 2014 到 2024 年的所有 NEOWISE 單次曝光探測（每個圖塊約 2000 萬個）。沒通過基本質素篩選（偽影標記、壞幀、月光、信號弱）的探測會被丟棄。WISE 大約每六個月掃描天空的每個部分，所以一個源在一次掃描中的探測會被平均成每次巡天一個位置。這些位置跨十年連成軌跡，包括每年最高 12 角秒的快速移動天體，再用直線擬合得到每條軌跡的自行及其不確定度。至少在 6 次巡天中被看到、每年至少移動 150 mas、且至少 5 sigma 的軌跡會被保留為移動天體。每個移動天體都會與按各自自行推算到同一日期的 Gaia DR3 恆星比較。Gaia 無法解釋的每個移動天體，接着會在 SPHEREx 的全天光譜立方體（第 1 次數據發佈，2025-26 年觀測）中查找：那裏有源嗎？它是否在 NEOWISE 的運動所預測的位置，並且已不在 2014 年的位置？SPHEREx 還給出它 0.75-5 微米的光譜，其中 3.3 微米處的甲烷凹陷和 3-5 微米的紅色（冷褐矮星的跡象）被當作提示。然後給移動天體排名：Gaia 無法解釋、偏紅、SPHEREx 在預測位置看到、軌跡又長又幹淨的排在前面。名單靠前的部分留給人來調查。",
