"Measured directly in SPHEREx's all-sky DR1 spectral cube (NASA/IPAC IRSA, read a few pixels at a time): SPHEREx has no source catalogue yet.": "直接在 SPHEREx 的全天 DR1 光譜立方體中測量（NASA/IPAC IRSA，一次讀取幾個像素）：SPHEREx 還沒有源星表。",
