"Through Webb opens the same sky map; choose its Through Webb tab to see any Webb image of this spot. SIMBAD": "“通過 Webb 看”會打開同一張星空圖；選它的“通過 Webb 看”標籤，可以看到這個位置的任何 Webb 圖像。SIMBAD",
"shows whether astronomers already know an object here. Backyard Worlds is the citizen-science project that hunts brown dwarfs in WISE images.": "會顯示天文學家是否已經知道這裏有個天體。Backyard Worlds 是在 WISE 圖像中尋找褐矮星的公民科學項目。",
"Look it up in other archives": "在其他檔案中查找",
"It moves, so each link uses the right date: sky viewers open where it should be today (moved with its measured motion), and catalogue searches use its J2000 position (SIMBAD, VizieR) or its 2016.0 position (Gaia DR3), with a radius that covers the uncertainty of that move plus a year of motion. Older images show it earlier along its path, and a few catalogue entries are for their own observing date: the wider SIMBAD search above covers its whole path since 2000.": "它會移動，所以每個連結都用對應的日期：星空查看器會打開它今天應在的位置（按測得的運動推算），星表搜尋則用它的 J2000 位置 (SIMBAD, VizieR) 或 2016.0 位置 (Gaia DR3)，搜尋半徑覆蓋這次推算的不確定度再加一年的運動。更早的圖像會顯示它沿路徑更早的位置，少數星表條目對應它們自己的觀測日期：上面更寬的 SIMBAD 搜尋覆蓋了它自 2000 年以來的整條路徑。",
"Where it is, year by year": "它逐年所在的位置",
"Straight-line predictions from the NEOWISE motion; the yearly parallax wobble is left out.": "根據 NEOWISE 運動做的直線預測；不包括每年的視差擺動。",
