"Everything is computed on your phone. Motion data never leaves it; your location only leaves it rounded to about 50 km, to fetch NASA's satellite picture of your region.": "所有計算都在你的手機上完成。運動數據不會離開手機;你的位置只會取整到約 50 km 後發出,用來獲取 NASA 拍的你所在地區的衞星圖片。",
