"Lay your phone flat on a table": "把手機平放在桌上",
"Screen up, hands off, away from laptops and magnets. Hold still until the first dot fills, then give it a quarter turn on the table and hold again: four times.": "螢幕朝上,鬆開手,遠離手提電腦和磁鐵。保持不動,直到第一個圓點填滿,然後在桌上轉四分之一圈,再保持不動:一共四次。",
"Why four? The gyroscope knows exactly how far you turned. If the compass disagrees, something nearby is bending it, and averaging four directions cancels the phone's own magnetic bias.": "為什麼是四次?陀螺儀準確知道你轉了多少。如果指南針不同意,説明附近有東西在干擾它;而把四個方向取平均,就能抵消手機自身的磁偏差。",
