". North is then set from what you see, and from then on the gyroscope alone keeps it: no more compass drift. The teal markers show where WANDERERS currently thinks landmarks are.": "。這樣北方就由你看到的東西來確定,之後只靠陀螺儀保持:不會再有指南針漂移。青色標記顯示 WANDERERS 目前認為地標所在的位置。",
