"). Webb pixels: ESA ESASky JWST maps. Background: DSS / 2MASS. What Webb is doing right now:": ")。韋伯的像素:ESA ESASky JWST 星圖。背景:DSS / 2MASS。韋伯此刻正在做什麼:",
"Where the numbers come from": "數據從哪裏來",
"Motion: the gyroscope drives every movement; the compass only sets north, averaged while the phone lies flat and corrected slowly after (sensor fusion, tested on simulated noisy sensors: 0.1–0.5° error, 0.1° wobble). Sky: J2000 positions precessed to today (IAU 1976), UTC time and Earth's rotation (IAU 1982 sidereal time) at your GPS position, refraction (Saemundsson). Magnetic north to true north: NOAA/BGS World Magnetic Model 2025. Earth imagery: NASA Blue Marble and Black Marble via NASA GIBS. Cities: GeoNames.": "運動:每一個動作都由陀螺儀驅動;指南針只用來確定北方,在手機平放時取平均,之後再緩慢修正(感應器融合,已用模擬的噪聲感應器測試:誤差 0.1–0.5°,抖動 0.1°)。天空:J2000 位置歲差修正到今天 (IAU 1976),在你的 GPS 位置使用 UTC 時間和地球自轉 (IAU 1982 恆星時),並做大氣折射修正 (Saemundsson)。磁北到真北:NOAA/BGS World Magnetic Model 2025。地球影像:NASA Blue Marble 和 Black Marble,經由 NASA GIBS 提供。城市:GeoNames。",
