". {0} saturated at the target pixel. {1} have flags within {2} pixels of the target: OVERFLOW ×{3}, SUR_ERROR ×{4}, BLOOM ×{5}, TRANSIENT ×{6}, PERSIST ×{7}, NONFUNC ×{8}, HOT ×{9}, CROSSTALK ×{10}, DICHROIC ×{11}. {12} are used in the spectrum. Flag names are the SPHEREx pipeline's (Explanatory Supplement); hover a flag for its meaning.": "。{0} 張在目標像素處飽和。{1} 張在目標 {2} 像素範圍內有標誌：OVERFLOW ×{3}，SUR_ERROR ×{4}，BLOOM ×{5}，TRANSIENT ×{6}，PERSIST ×{7}，NONFUNC ×{8}，HOT ×{9}，CROSSTALK ×{10}，DICHROIC ×{11}。{12} 張用於光譜。標誌名稱來自 SPHEREx 流水線（Explanatory Supplement）；懸停在標誌上可查看含義。",
