"{0} Cygni is a pair of orange dwarf stars. In {1} it became the first star to have its distance measured, and Gaia's parallax puts it about {2} light-years away. WANDERERS saw it move {3} arcseconds between {4} and {5}. That is {6} arcseconds per year, within {7}% of Gaia's {8}, so confidence is high. There are caveats. The Gaia match sits {9} arcseconds from the typed position, and the star is too bright for SPHEREx. All {10} measurements are flagged and there is no spectrum. The brightness looked steady (+{11} ± {12} mag), but that comes from the star's outer glow.": "{0} Cygni 是一對橙矮星。{1} 年它成為第一顆被測出距離的恆星，Gaia 的視差顯示它約在 {2} 光年外。WANDERERS 看到它在 {4} 與 {5} 之間移動了 {3} 角秒。即每年 {6} 角秒，與 Gaia 的 {8} 相差在 {7}% 以內，所以置信度高。也有注意事項。Gaia 匹配星距你輸入的位置 {9} 角秒，而且這顆星對 SPHEREx 太亮。全部 {10} 次測量都被標記，沒有光譜。亮度看起來穩定（+{11} ± {12} mag），但這來自恆星的外圍光暈。",
