"Each detector's co-add of a visit is background-subtracted and divided by its own robust noise (median and {0} x MAD); the co-adds are then summed and divided by the square root of their number, so the picture is in units of the noise and no detector dominates. It mixes wavelengths, so motion is still measured at {1} and {2} µm only.": "每個探測器的一次巡天疊加圖先扣除背景，再除以它自己的穩健噪聲（中位數和 {0} x MAD）；然後把各疊加圖相加，再除以其數量的平方根，所以圖像以噪聲為單位，沒有哪個探測器佔主導。它混合了多個波長，所以運動仍然只在 {1} 和 {2} µm 測量。",
