"Between {0} and {1} this star moved {2} arcseconds across the sky, about {3} arcseconds per year, which matches Gaia DR{4}'s catalogue speed to within {5} percent. Gaia's parallax puts it only {6} light-years away, so it really is a close, fast-moving neighbour. One caution: it is too bright for SPHEREx, so all {7} SPHEREx measurements are flagged, and its brightness change (-{8} ± {9} mag) did not pass the steadiness check.": "在 {0} 與 {1} 之間，這顆星在天空中移動了 {2} 角秒，約每年 {3} 角秒，與 Gaia DR{4} 星表速度相差在百分之 {5} 以內。Gaia 的視差顯示它只有 {6} 光年遠，所以它確實是一個近鄰，而且運動很快。有一點要注意：它對 SPHEREx 太亮，所以全部 {7} 次 SPHEREx 測量都被標記，它的亮度變化（-{8} ± {9} mag）沒通過穩定性檢查。",
"Very little could shake this, because the measured speed matches Gaia's to within {0}%. The weak spots are SPHEREx itself. All {1} of its measurements are flagged because the star is too bright for the detector. The −{2} ± {3} magnitude change comes only from the faint outer glow, because the centre of the image is saturated, so I can't call that change real. A bigger mismatch with Gaia would worry me.": "幾乎沒有什麼能動搖這個結果，因為測得速度與 Gaia 相差在 {0}% 以內。薄弱環節在 SPHEREx 本身。它的全部 {1} 次測量都被標記，因為這顆星對探測器太亮。−{2} ± {3} 星等的變化只來自微弱的外圍光暈，因為圖像中心飽和，所以我不能説這個變化是真的。與 Gaia 差得更多才會讓我擔心。",
"NEOWISE Aug {0} · {1} µm · saturated (too bright for this camera)": "NEOWISE 8月 {0} · {1} µm · 飽和（對這台相機太亮）",
"WISE photographed this sky in {0} and SPHEREx in {1} and {2}, so together they span about {3} years. Over that time Kapteyn's Star moved {4} arcseconds, about {5} SPHEREx pixels, which is easy to measure. That gives {6} arcseconds per year, matching Gaia's {7}. SPHEREx alone covers only one year, and all {8} of its measurements here are flagged because the star is too bright for it.": "WISE 在 {0} 拍了這片天空，SPHEREx 在 {1} 和 {2} 拍攝，所以兩者合起來跨越約 {3} 年。在這段時間裏 Kapteyn's Star 移動了 {4} 角秒，約 {5} 個 SPHEREx 像素，很容易測量。這得出每年 {6} 角秒，與 Gaia 的 {7} 一致。SPHEREx 單獨只覆蓋一年，而且這裏它的全部 {8} 次測量都被標記，因為這顆星對它太亮。",
"The search found no pair of dots that looks like a moving object here.": "搜尋沒有找到看起來像運動天體的亮點對。",
